WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.130
Strike a match, and
it bursts into flame.

2
00:00:03.180 --> 00:00:06.070
Once it is alight, it
keeps burning on its own,

3
00:00:06.120 --> 00:00:08.090
giving out heat and light.

4
00:00:08.140 --> 00:00:10.310
But leave the same match in its box,

5
00:00:10.360 --> 00:00:13.090
and it never catches fire by itself.

6
00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:15.110
If burning gives out energy,

7
00:00:15.160 --> 00:00:17.990
why does a match need
a push to get started?

8
00:00:18.040 --> 00:00:20.950
In this mission, you'll sort
reactions that warm their

9
00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:23.640
surroundings from reactions
that cool them down.

10
00:00:23.690 --> 00:00:26.270
You'll draw diagrams of
a reaction's energy,

11
00:00:26.320 --> 00:00:30.090
and find the energy hump that a
reaction has to get over before

12
00:00:30.140 --> 00:00:31.450
it can happen.

13
00:00:31.500 --> 00:00:35.230
Your mission: explain why a
burning match needs a strike to

14
00:00:35.280 --> 00:00:36.270
start.
